#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/quickstart.md:33
#: bfebc9ad45ca465fb2e913a43b930e4e
msgid ""
"Inspect the output, logs, test results, and diff. Accept, request a "
"correction, quarantine, or stop; do not silently promote a generated result."
